                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is the game I have been looking for. It reminds me so much of one of my fav games \"Gang Beasts\" and it involves PIGEONS!!! Who doesn't love pigeons? I mean they are after all the cutest and greatest animal of all time. So mixing one of my fav games with pigeons is just amazing. I love the minigames and the accesories. The only downfall is this game isn't online multiplayer but I often have a friend or two come over to play. Plus there is AI! \n\nOverall this game is amazing and I highly reccomend it.",
